  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- (1.1.0) Features and Enhancements\n\n      - Minimal ORM Core:\n      Introduced a minimal ORM for .NET, empowering developers with full control over SQL execution. The design prioritizes performance, predictability, and transparent object hydration.\n\n      - SqlWhereBuilder Improvements:\n      Enhanced the `SqlWhereBuilder` with new options for flexible and expressive WHERE clause construction, enabling more advanced query scenarios.\n\n      - ExecuteNonQuery Overloads:\n      Added new `ExecuteNonQuery(string, object)` method overloads to support external `DbTransaction` parameterization, improving transaction management and integration with existing workflows.\n\n      - Nested Entity Mapping:\n      Refactored `SqlEntityMap` to provide more robust and efficient mapping of nested SQL entities, including improved primary key detection, entity instantiation, and value conversion logic.",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "Hydrix",
